      "features": [
        "README: open source performance/load testing tool for HTTP and other protocols; tests are defined in regular Python code with HttpUser/task.",
        "README: tests can run from the command line or the web-based UI; the web UI shows test progress in real time and allows changing the load while the test is running.",
        "README: throughput, response times and errors are visible in real time and/or exported; distributed runs let one process drive many concurrent users across multiple machines."
